{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2021-11-02 10:00:00', 'title': "UPS AIMS TO HIRE 60,000 AT ‘UPS BROWN FRIDAY' EVENTS NATIONWIDE", 'text': "ATLANTA, NOV. 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- UPS (NYSE: UPS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT EXPECTS TO HIRE AT LEAST 60,000 SEASONAL EMPLOYEES THIS THURSDAY THROUGH SATURDAY, IN ITS ANNUAL ‘UPS BROWN FRIDAY' EVENTS AT COMPANY LOCATIONS ACROSS THE COUNTRY."}